@startuml SD-15-notify-staff
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam ArrowColor black
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor white
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor black
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor white
skinparam ActorBorderColor black
skinparam BoundaryBackgroundColor white
skinparam BoundaryBorderColor black
skinparam ControlBackgroundColor white
skinparam ControlBorderColor black
skinparam EntityBackgroundColor white
skinparam EntityBorderColor black
skinparam SequenceLifeLineBorderColor black
skinparam SequenceGroupBorderColor black
skinparam SequenceGroupBackgroundColor white
skinparam SequenceReferenceBackgroundColor white
skinparam SequenceReferenceBorderColor black
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor white
skinparam NoteBorderColor black
skinparam dpi 150
hide footbox
skinparam maxMessageSize 420
skinparam wrapWidth 420
skinparam sequenceParticipantFontSize 12
skinparam sequenceActorFontSize 12
autonumber
title SD-15: Notify Staff (UC-15)
' Traces: UC-15; FR-49, FR-64, FR-71; NFR-01, NFR-09
' Round-2 detail sources: DEC-62.
' Sources: DEC-43, DEC-46, DEC-48, DEC-50; DEC-55, DEC-56; sequence-diagram-review.md.
' Round-2 source: DEC-58; sequence-diagram-review-round-2.md.
' Current source: INT-DCT [Questionnaire C16: DB01]; DEC-69.
' Round-3 source: DEC-68; sequence-diagram-review-round-3.md.
control ":NotificationService" as NS
entity ":Notification" as NO
actor "Email Service" as ES
actor "SMS Gateway" as SMS

[-> NS ++ : notify(event, recipients)
NS -> NS : partitionByWeek(event, recipients)
loop each affected week or non-roster event
  alt roster-related event for a Draft week
    NS -> NS : suppressDraftDelivery(event)
  else affected week Published or event not roster-related
    loop for each recipient
      NS -> NS : buildMessage(savedEvent)
      NS -->> NO ** : <<create>>(recipient, message)
      note right of NO
        Job/request, date and saved outcome;
        changed time/Crew where relevant, any decision reason,
        and link to current details. Landing Page message is kept.
      end note
      NS -> ES : sendEmail(recipient, message)
      ES --> NS : accepted / failed
      loop up to 3 retries while email failed
        NS -> ES : sendEmail(recipient, message)
        ES --> NS : accepted / failed
      end
      opt email still failed
        NS -> NO : markChannelFailed(email)
      end
      NS -> SMS : sendSMS(recipient, message)
      SMS --> NS : accepted / failed
      loop up to 3 retries while SMS failed
        NS -> SMS : sendSMS(recipient, message)
        SMS --> NS : accepted / failed
      end
      opt SMS still failed
        NS -> NO : markChannelFailed(SMS)
      end
    end
  end
end
[<-- NS -- : notification outcome
legend bottom
Mixed-date events are partitioned by affected week before delivery;
Draft payloads and recipients never enter the delivery loop (DEC-64).
Email Service and SMS Gateway realise the existing Email/Phone actor
(DEC-48, DEC-56).
Notify only after the business event is saved; delivery failure does
not undo it.
Saved changes are visible within 60 s (NFR-01);
acknowledgement/deduplication remain open (DEC-62).
Draft roster events create no Staff message and send no email/SMS.
Publication sends the published roster notification (FR-49, DEC-64).
endlegend
@enduml
